WEBVTT

00:19:59.663 --> 00:20:02.038
the beauty of film when the beauty
of art and the beauty of

00:20:02.038 --> 00:20:03.413
a cultural world in which we live.

00:20:04.496 --> 00:20:06.663
You know, we've been talking
about movies and cinema,

00:20:06.663 --> 00:20:08.371
but obviously the experience of watching

00:20:08.371 --> 00:20:10.829
a film has changed dramatically
with theaters being closed.

00:20:11.079 --> 00:20:13.454
I guess even if they're open,
people being scared to go.

00:20:13.954 --> 00:20:15.829
I even think about that a
little bit personally,

00:20:15.829 --> 00:20:18.371
because there's a movie theater right
down the block from where

00:20:18.371 --> 00:20:19.413
I live here in Los Angeles.

00:20:19.413 --> 00:20:24.163
And on their big marquee rather than new
movie title, it says to be continued.

00:20:24.788 --> 00:20:28.496
But it's said that for months now and
their doors still haven't reopened.

00:20:28.496 --> 00:20:33.538
So what at first was kind of just like
charming and even funny sign is now